WEBVTT

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:09.180
Reincarnation and rebirth shroud love and hate in mist

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:14.720
We were once acquainted and our azure swords crossed

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:21.640
From the depths of the clouds flows a melody of zither and flute

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:27.160
The physical realm is transient, like the drunken dream of a lone soul

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:31.070
Overlooking both good and evil, I witness the chaos of life

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.200
Side by side, we fight against the world

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.200
Not once did I betray my principles

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:42.860
Leading a carefree life, I have transcended virtues and vices

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.160
Yet I cannot erase the scars within my heart

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:51.280
In this life, we shall not be caught in strife

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:55.040
Steering clear of worldly affairs,

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.690
we walk different paths while keeping justice in our hearts

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:03.290
I had been chivalrous and righteous, yet my deeds were all in vain

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:07.080
Good and evil are black and white

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.600
But the border between love and hate remains blurred

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:16.000
Knowing you is like a dream

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:37.360
Leave.

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:40.680
Leave!

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:43.880
Hold it!

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.110
Wen Ning!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:57.960
Uncle!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.290
Uncle!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.250
Clan Leader.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.420
Chase it!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.400
Yes, sir!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.190
Second Young Master Lan, I've had a question for you since the incident on Mt. Dafan.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.080
Why did you let the Ghost General escape?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.240
What? Nothing to say?

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.040
Hanguang-Jun has never been much of a talker!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:17.450
You again?

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:23.680
Once may be a coincidence, but twice simply cannot be explained away as one.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.820
Coincidence? What coincidence?

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.340
You wanna whip me again?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.650
Zidian has already proved that I'm not possessed.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.210
Clan Leader Jiang, do you not trust your clan's magical tools?

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.350
Whether I trust them or not is none of your concern.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:44.620
But today, I <i>will</i>  find out who and what you are!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.560
Lan Wangji, are you deliberately getting in my way?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:02.520
Uncle, Mo Xuanyu seems to be a distinguished guest of the Gusu Lan Clan right now.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.360
Distinguished guest?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:10.960
Ridiculous!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.320
Nowadays, anyone can become a "distinguished guest" of yours.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.900
Hmph! "Righteous cultivators"?

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.590
You better not end up in my hands.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.480
Uncle! The Ghost General...

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.240
Shut up.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.190
How many times have I told you not to night hunt alone?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.840
I cannot handle you any more!

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.640
Oh, this is bad.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.160
If Clan Leader Jiang is after me,

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:49.520
then I'll never get away from him, not even in a few lifetimes!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.240
If you come with me, he will not trouble you.

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.810
A seam?

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.990
It can be found on all of these corpses at various locations.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:11.820
No wonder that crazy woman screeched at the sound of meat being cleaved.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.010
She probably saw bodies being chopped to pieces.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:17.370
But why cut up the corpses, then sew them back?

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:30.330
Other than the head, the corpses bear no traces of vicious energy.

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:31.640
I get it!

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.850
Someone split the bodies to release resentful energy,

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.990
then stitched the pieces onto normal corpses to suppress its vicious aura.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:40.280
This is...

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:43.080
I have never seen this rune before.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:45.390
Mm. It's a first for me too.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.300
However,

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.880
it looks very similar to an array that blocks out resentful energy,

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:53.400
except that the order of brush strokes, thus its power, has been entirely reversed.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:58.270
I believe this rune can absorb a lot of resentful energy in a short time.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.160
A man-made fuel for vicious energy...

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.540
Although the effect only lasts for a short while, it is very powerful.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:08.640
A few days' time is all it needs to create a vicious feral zombie.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:13.200
So 11 years ago, someone researched whether they could use dismembered corpses

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.960
to suppress vicious energy in this very location.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:19.880
Huaicang Hill is not only remote, but also concealed by the Zombie Trap Array.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.790
If Jin Zixun's head had not triggered the abnormal flow of energy,

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.700
the secrets of this hill would still remain hidden.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.200
Jin Zixun's head is also worth an examination.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.800
Since it could move as it pleased within the Array,

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.640
it had no reason to stay silent for 11 years.

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.720
The only explanation is...

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:42.990
This head arrived here only 2 days ago.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.840
Coincidentally, on the day you brought the ghost hand to the Cloud Recesses.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:49.960
How interesting!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.700
If someone carefully plotted the events leading up to this,

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:56.520
what could they possibly want you to find out for them?

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.670
So what was Lan Wangji doing at Huaicang Hill?

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.570
I have no idea.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.950
Our spy took his own life before he could bring back more information.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.530
For now, do not rush into action.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.590
They won't be able to discover anything on that puny Huaicang Hill.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.350
Understood.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.490
I have a question to ask.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.000
You said before that only a few people could breach the Zombie Trap Array.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.390
Of course, this array is a lost art.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:24.420
Was it breached?

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:25.980
It was.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.850
It shouldn't be.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.120
No matter how strong Lan Wangji's cultivation base is...

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:32.920
It was not Lan Wangji who breached it,

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:36.240
but a nobody at his side named Mo Xuanyu.

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:54.220
Destroy!

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.420
Mo Xuanyu?

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:22.460
Hanguang-Jun, all the corpses have been disposed of.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.650
We did not find a body inflicted with the Ulcerating Curse

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:26.590
or any clue related to the ghost hand.

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:29.780
Purge the evil beings first.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:30.840
Understood.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.990
Nothing at all?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.820
Right, no one said it would be easy.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.790
Too bad that all their souls were severely damaged.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.640
Inquiring them won't work in this case.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.360
But if there's nothing to be found,

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.800
why did someone go to great lengths to lead us here?

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.450
What is that crazy woman doing here?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.910
Where did she get these toys from?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.110
You hag! How can you bite me?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.160
A body!

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.200
This scar is...

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.990
A frost flower sword-cut.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:03.920
Do you know anything about it?

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:06.970
Have you ever heard the name "Xiao Xingchen"?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:07.790
Never.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.480
He was a master cultivator.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:15.760
12 years ago, he left his mountain and rose to fame with his sword, Shuanghua*.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:24.110
One of his moves, "Frost Falling Sword", would leave frost flower sword-cuts behind.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.890
Xiao Xingchen was devoted to the betterment of the world

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.300
and had a noble character.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:42.940
Perhaps it was him who put an end to this 11 years ago.

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.060
Sounds like a wonderful person.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.170
Which mountain did he come from and who was his master?

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.080
I do not know which mountain,

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:55.930
but his master was Baoshan Sanren.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:10.680
Oh no!

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:03.560
Those demonic cultivators are truly wicked!

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:06.500
How could they come up with such an evil array, and even—

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.140
The one who created the Zombie Trap Array

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.060
had nothing to do with demonic cultivators.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.190
Then who was he?

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:14.680
A distinguished cultivator from hundreds of years ago.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.920
Also, this is not an evil array.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.970
It was used to save people by temporarily

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.670
immobilising the overwhelming hordes of zombies.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.990
The sword is but a weapon.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:27.990
It may save or kill according to the will of its user.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:32.510
The choice between good and evil often lies on a single thought.

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:36.250
Good and evil on a thought?

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:40.380
Then I wonder what's in the mind of the schemer behind all of this...

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.700
This is... the Soul Expel Seal?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:45.360
Yes.

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:48.400
Judging from the technique, it must have been made by that same person.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.960
But a few strokes are missing, so it looks more like an experimental design.

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:54.220
Perhaps the one who led us here

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.090
had hoped that we would immediately undo the Seal?

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:58.090
A fair guess.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.520
If we follow the clues and build upon them, the answer will become obvious!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:05.520
But if that person can hardly wait, why won't he undo it himself?

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:09.560
Not many people in this world can break the Seal, y'know.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.040
You're the most shameless braggart I've ever met!

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:16.200
Hanguang-Jun!

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:17.930
Why such haste?

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.680
Urgent message from the Cloud Recesses: "The ghost hand has escaped"!

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:37.680
Clan Leader.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.840
Any trace of the ghost hand?

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:45.190
Clan Leader, 3 Watch Towers have detected an abnormal amount of resentful energy.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:59.290
According to their positions, the ghost hand has most likely fled to...

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.510
Qinghe.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:08.440
Pass my order: hunt down the ghost hand to prevent further casualties.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:09.290
Yes, sir.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.660
But... where should we search?

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:16.200
The Compass of Evil?

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.780
I know that it can point to vicious fiends,

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:21.190
but it won't just target the ghost hand!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:26.730
What's this?

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.170
A type of linking spell.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.330
The ghost hand pointed towards the head

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.640
even though they weren't from the same body

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.780
because of this spell.

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.970
Hanguang-Jun, lend me your Evil-Sealing Pouch.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:45.190
The more vicious energy is contained within the linking spell, the harder it is to cast.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:49.360
Whoever cast this spell must have been a master of demonic arts.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.260
Are you intending to rely on the linking spell to track down the ghost hand?

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:54.840
Exactly.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.920
However, the Linking Spell usually doesn't last long.

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:04.940
Let's hope it still works.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:19.340
Where is Wen Ning?

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.480
Clan Leader, I... failed.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:25.920
But some disciples located the Ghost General in Qinghe.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.480
Are you certain of it?

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:28.990
Well...

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:32.740
What about Jin Ling?

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.490
Fairy has ran away and Young Master Jin is chasing after it.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:39.200
Enough. We're going to Qinghe.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.980
Why does the Linking Spell have to lose effect now?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.840
Hanguang-Jun.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.840
The ghost hand brims with evil energy.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.200
Wherever it is, strange phenomena will occur.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:06.700
I guess we need to find another way.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.460
I'm exhausted and the heat is killing me.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:12.810
What's that?

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.650
Cornetto Ice-cream!

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.320
Would you like some?

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.190
It's been a while since I ate this. I missed it so much!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.760
Still so wonderful and crispy!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.900
Hanguang-Jun, don't you want some?

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.850
"Yiling Patriarch" at 5 coins per sheet! 10 coins for 3!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:40.740
Great deal at bargain price! Don't miss out on it!

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:45.390
Dark clouds and evil spirits are looming over us.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.400
Why not defeat evil with evil? Combat poison with poison!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.150
Do you... want some?

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:59.990
Wei Wuxian was ranked fourth among noble young masters!

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:03.070
He was widely known to be a handsome, dashing gentleman!

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.210
So who are you trying to draw here?

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:06.640
Well...

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:12.940
If anyone mentions Wei Wuxian in front of me,

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.340
they'll need to beg on their knees if they want my mercy!

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.650
If you dare to yell about him in the streets, I'll kill you!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:19.960
Jin Ling...

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.900
You damn lunatic! Why aren't you running away?

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:23.280
Very well.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:26.160
What? You want to take me to your uncle for a reward?

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:30.080
Don't forget who pinned <i>who</i>  to the ground last time.

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.620
Lan... Lan Zhan! Save me!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.760
Fairy, let's go!

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:09.580
So... did you catch wind of anything unusual, Hanguang-jun?

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:13.800
Last night, zombies suddenly ran amok on the nearby Xinglu Ridge,

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:15.600
harming many of the mountain dwellers.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.920
Then we need to check it out.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:22.170
Young Masters, I suggest you avoid that place.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:25.400
Xinglu Ridge has another name: Man-eating Ridge.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:28.480
Rumours say that the Man-eating Castle,

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:30.730
home to man-eating monsters, sits on the ridge.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:36.240
Also, intruders would be completely devoured until not even bones were left.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.800
How long has this been going on?

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.640
For many years!

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.420
The Qinghe Nie Clan didn't take any actions?

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.770
Qinghe Nie Clan?

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:46.120
If it had been the same Qinghe Nie Clan from years ago,

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.870
of course it wouldn't have sat by and watched.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:49.980
But the current leader of the Nie Clan

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.740
will not talk about what he doesn't know

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.610
and is too afraid to say what he does know.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.420
People call him a "Total Ignoramus"*.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.170
He depended on Lanling Jin Clan and Gusu Lan Clan

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.500
to help him secure the position of clan leader.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:04.490
Clan Leader, something odd happened on Xinglu Ridge. What should we do?

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.560
Well...

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:12.780
I don't know. I don't know! I <i>really</i>  don't know!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.590
Bad Fairy...

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:21.790
There's no pot roast ahead. Why are you running so fast?

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.260
There doesn't seem to be any man-eating monsters around.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.200
That Daoist was talking nonsense.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.020
A dog!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:48.080
Are you... afraid of dogs?

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:51.800
I have bad memories from my childhood.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:44.030
Calm down, don't panic. You're safe now.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:48.380
Come, let's go home.
